/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 718 Tm (Overfitting refers to the phenomenon where the training error keeps) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (decreasing while the validation error starts to rise after a certain) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 682 Tm (epoch. The model is fitting noise in the training samples as if it) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 664 Tm (were signal. A reliable symptom is not the absolute value of the) Tj
