/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 760 Tm (Dropout randomly zeroes the output of a fraction p of neurons at) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 742 Tm (each training iteration. At inference no neuron is dropped, but) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 724 Tm (weights must be rescaled by the keep probability to preserve the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 706 Tm (expected output. Dropout can be read as an implicit ensemble of) Tj
