/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 632 Tm (Early stopping halts training when validation loss stops improving) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 614 Tm (for a number of consecutive epochs and rolls back to the best) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 596 Tm (checkpoint. It requires no change to the loss function and is the) Tj
